WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.352
- What the f- is this?

00:00:02.352 --> 00:00:04.172
Like why would you ever do this?

00:00:04.172 --> 00:00:07.005
(energetic music)

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.371
- Oh gosh.

00:00:40.371 --> 00:00:41.433
- Hey.

00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:42.468
- What is this?

00:00:42.468 --> 00:00:44.096
- Why does this exist?

00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:45.870
- (laughs)

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.272
- Why is there a marshmallow on the end?

00:00:48.272 --> 00:00:52.370
- Are marshmallows supposed
to go with hot dogs?

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:54.128
- Is this how she served it?

00:00:54.128 --> 00:00:56.897
Is this what it looked like?

00:00:56.897 --> 00:01:00.564
- Oh, well what is it
supposed to look like?

00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:05.158
- So this is inspired by Filipino food.

00:01:05.158 --> 00:01:06.958
- I'm gonna eat it just for the sake

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.567
of not having to look at it.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:09.632
- Rule number one,

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:13.870
everything needs to be
aesthetically pleasing.

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:14.804
- All right, you want me to eat this?

00:01:14.804 --> 00:01:16.559
- Do I eat, just like
the whole marshmallow

00:01:16.559 --> 00:01:17.531
and a little bit?

00:01:17.531 --> 00:01:19.367
- It's got to be marshmallow first.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:22.158
- See, I feel like I need to
divide this marshmallow up.

00:01:22.158 --> 00:01:23.723
Okay, that looks better, right?

00:01:23.723 --> 00:01:24.640
- I guess I'll try it.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:28.807
I'll eat the marshmallow
and the sausage together.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:35.266
- Oh my god, it's so nasty.

00:01:35.266 --> 00:01:36.766
- No, it's so bad!

00:01:37.805 --> 00:01:41.143
- I grabbed the whole marshmallow
in my mouth (mumbles).

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:43.628
- It tastes like a hot
dog with sugar on it.

00:01:43.628 --> 00:01:46.497
- That's not a good food combination.

00:01:46.497 --> 00:01:47.920
Who the fuck thought of this?

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.899
- I actually kind of like it.

00:01:49.899 --> 00:01:50.954
Savory and sweet.

00:01:50.954 --> 00:01:52.249
It's actually pretty good.

00:01:52.249 --> 00:01:53.597
- It's not the worst thing ever.

00:01:53.597 --> 00:01:57.339
Almost like if a hot dog
bun were like really sugary.

00:01:57.339 --> 00:01:59.806
It's way more offensive
to look at than to eat.

00:01:59.806 --> 00:02:02.829
- This does not scream
"rich" by any means.

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:05.691
- Maybe if her kid, like, loves this

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:07.348
and they like went to the Philippines

00:02:07.348 --> 00:02:08.407
and they had this.

00:02:08.407 --> 00:02:10.054
- "Oh my gosh, this is
the best thing ever.

00:02:10.054 --> 00:02:11.180
"Mom, make this for me on my birthday."

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.362
- I probably would eat this.

00:02:12.362 --> 00:02:13.402
I would eat anything as a kid.

00:02:13.402 --> 00:02:15.021
- It did save me going out to lunch,

00:02:15.021 --> 00:02:16.345
which I was about to do.

00:02:16.345 --> 00:02:18.216
Marshmallow and hot dogs. (laughs)

00:02:18.216 --> 00:02:21.049
(energetic music)

00:02:37.918 --> 00:02:39.593
- Tastes like a hot dog and marshmallow.

00:02:39.593 --> 00:02:40.994
Maybe kids would actually like it, though.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:42.899
Like what's not to like when
you're like seven years old?

00:02:42.899 --> 00:02:44.030
A hot dog, marshmallow?

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.950
- Who did this? Ivanka Trump?

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.767
What compelled her to be like,

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.611
"Yeah, we should just multitask."

00:02:49.611 --> 00:02:51.060
What, are you gonna put the whole thing

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.600
in your mouth at once?

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.597
Listen, that's tripe (mumbles).

00:02:54.597 --> 00:02:57.430
(energetic music)

